                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This study on the labour participation of single parents in the Netherlands is based on a survey among 1140 respondents in 1999: 688 economically independent single parents and 452 single mothers who also participated a year before. (See the research project 'Working and caring by single parents in the Netherlands'.)</p>"
                }
